abstract: >-
  NEXUS is an experimental evidence-governed AI engineering architecture
  containing engineering, provenance, experimental-validation, federation,
  domain-system and external-verification research surfaces. The canonical
  experiments remain blocked/pending at this release point; scientific
  validation and independent replication are not claimed.
